[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2796627422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2796627422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2796627422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6msSXe","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-11T11:24:47Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T11:24:47Z","body":"This sounds like something that needs an MRP to get this testable, so please upload one","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2796627422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799856868","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2799856868","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2799856868,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6m4mzk","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-13T08:24:08Z","updated_at":"2025-04-13T08:58:25Z","body":"I added a MRP but sadly, I could not replicate the issue with it! \nI don't succeed to find what is different between my main project and the MRP.\n\nI may be able to share the source of the main project.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2799856868/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835384440","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2835384440","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2835384440,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pAIh4","user":{"login":"catprisbrey","id":43008564,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDA4NTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43008564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey","html_url":"https://github.com/catprisbrey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T14:09:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T14:09:45Z","body":"So what you see here, and what was mentioned in the Reddit post I continually run into in my project but have been unable to produce a minimal project to share here. I've gotten Godot to throw errors that the blend amount is an integer while I'm trying to lerp it like a float. When I do check code everywhere, there is no reason it's an integer.\n\nAnd the hacky fix  I use to make it work, in the animation tree I move the blend amount to ANYTHING but 0.0, and then at game time it runs fine. If it's at zero it comes back as an integer.\n\nProblem is, it works when I try to narrow it down to just the apparent problem. So I'm half suspicious that it has something to do with when the blend node is nested, or grouped deeper than at root level, or something along those lines. That the more complex tree is part of what makes the problem manifest.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835384440/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835615844","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2835615844","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2835615844,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pBBBk","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T15:20:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T15:22:47Z","body":"You are changing the type of the parameter by assigning it an int in your example code. The issue can be replicated if you add this to the MRP.\n\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tanim_tree[\"parameters/blend_aim/blend_amount\"] = 0\n```\n\nSince tween interpolates based on the parameter type, it snaps between 0-1 instead of lerping between 0.0-1.0.\n\nThe type shouldn't be allowed to change, but I'm not sure if it's possible to avoid it on the engine side since these parameters are dynamic.\n\n> And the hacky fix I use to make it work, in the animation tree I move the blend amount to ANYTHING but 0.0, and then at game time it runs fine. If it's at zero it comes back as an integer.\n\nI think until some version ago, 0.0 floats were saved as 0 in the scene file. If you are not assigning it an int anywhere, try searching \"blend_amount\" on the `.tscn` files to see if it is assigning an int or a float.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835615844/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835862305","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2835862305","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2835862305,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pB9Mh","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T16:45:24Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:45:24Z","body":"Thank you so much @catprisbrey and @ydeltastar ! I will give it a try tonight.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835862305/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835893952","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2835893952","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2835893952,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pCE7A","user":{"login":"catprisbrey","id":43008564,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDA4NTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43008564?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey","html_url":"https://github.com/catprisbrey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catprisbrey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T16:56:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T16:56:40Z","body":"@ydeltastar I suspected it could be that, but then it was odd that it didn't occur in a simpler MRP when i was trying to isolate the problem, everything worked. So i scratched my head, and rather than adjust all my code to forse ints and floats in various places, i just offset my initial blend pos, and moved along. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2835893952/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844964344","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2844964344","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2844964344,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pkrX4","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T14:36:22Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T14:39:06Z","body":"I remember seeing an Int and Float tween issue somewhere before like https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/87326. Can you take a look at this @KoBeWi ?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2844964344/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845525890","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2845525890","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2845525890,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pm0eC","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-01T19:07:53Z","updated_at":"2025-05-01T19:07:53Z","body":"`set_parameter()` takes Variant and does no type validation. That might be the cause. `anim_tree[\"parameters/blend_aim/blend_amount\"] = 0` will change the internal parameter's type.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2845525890/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883266383","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2883266383","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2883266383,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r2ydP","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T10:03:53Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T10:03:53Z","body":"I can confirm that to replace my 0 and 1 with 0.0 and 1.0 solves the issue.\n\nI will close the issue, but let us know if you think it should be re-opened.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883266383/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883382704","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2883382704","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2883382704,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r3O2w","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T10:48:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T10:48:08Z","body":"I think changing internal parameter type is not expected behavior. The method should have some validation and throw errors if you use wrong type.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2883382704/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2908113666","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105275#issuecomment-2908113666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105275","id":2908113666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tVksC","user":{"login":"Twocans","id":5831856,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4MzE4NTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5831856?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans","html_url":"https://github.com/Twocans","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Twocans/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-25T22:02:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-25T22:02:36Z","body":"I had this issue too on 4.4.1 but I already had the blend amounts set to 0.0 and 1.0. I also tried adding .from_current() to initialize the values but that didn't work either. I solved it by adding: animation_tree[\"parameters/crouching_branch/blend_amount\"] = 0.0 to the _ready() function but I haven't had to do this for any of the other blend tweens within the same animation tree. Maybe I initialized them somewhere else and just forgot but I feel they should be floats by default anyway.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2908113666/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]